WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
One decision. Three owners. Fully traceable.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Start with a clear brief. How should annotators review tracking labels, and what must the pilot prove?

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Workflow proposes two confirmed anchors. Quality challenges the assumption. Confidence at frame ten tells us little about frame five.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:27.000
The host asks for a decision. Review every intermediate frame, keep human corrections, and test the limits before extending.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Open Plan. Three concrete tasks, each with an owner. They remain planned, ready for the next step.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Click Conversation source to return to the exact decision behind the task. The reason stays with the work.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Foxul. Multiple agents. One clear outcome.
